VIDAA Eco
=========

VIDAA Eco is a fork of and builds directly on the work of Warren Rees:

  * ha_vidaatv  - https://github.com/warrenrees/ha_vidaatv   (Home Assistant integration)
  * pyvidaa     - https://github.com/warrenrees/pyvidaa      (VIDAA protocol library)

The original projects are licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE). All
VIDAA protocol reverse-engineering, the pairing/credential implementation, and
the base Home Assistant integration are the work of the original author and are
used here with gratitude.

VIDAA Eco adds idle/sleep detection and automatic power-off, hardened device
identity, and an HDMI-signal sensor, on top of that foundation. Where changes
are protocol-level rather than power-save behaviour, the intent is to contribute
them back upstream.
